OL,3,AArizona congressional candidate says
OL,4,Ashe was raped while repairing campaign
OL,5,Asign
OL,6,
OL,7,FA congressional candidate in Arizona
OL,8,Fhas said she was raped in a car park as
OL,9,Fshe repaired campaign signs late at
OL,10,Fnight in her district.
OL,12,FBernadette Greene-Placentia, a
OL,13,FDemocrat, told the Phoenix New Times
OL,14,Fshe was knocked unconscious during the
OL,15,Falleged attack in the Phoenix suburb of
OL,16,FSun City on 14 August, waking up to
OL,17,Ffind a man on top of her.
OL,19,FShe said she did not initially notify
OL,20,Fpolice until filing a report with the
OL,21,FMaricopa County Sheriff's Office two
OL,22,Fweeks later.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
