OL,6,
OL,7,FHer Republican opponent, Abraham
OL,8,FHamadeh, urged authorities in a
OL,9,Fstatement to "investigate these serious
OL,10,Fallegations thoroughly, including
OL,11,Ffinding all possible camera footage of
OL,12,Fthe time and place".
